---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    participant Page as Admin sites page<br/>/admin/sites, AddSiteModal.tsx
    participant Actions as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase<br/>PostgreSQL

    Note over Admin,DB: Covers US 2.0.2. The Add Site flow exists (#153). Only AT1 (select a boundary) and AT6 (suggestions) are not done.<br/>"(Proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.<br/>ProtectedRoute requireAdmin hides the page in the browser only. It reads app_metadata in the browser, so it is not a security check.

    Admin->>Page: Select "Add Site" (data-testid add-site-button)
    activate Page
    Page-->>Admin: Open AddSiteModal

    %% AT6 is not merged. protected_areas exists, but no column links a boundary to a sites_pa row.
    opt Suggest boundaries from the KML (Proposed, AT6)
        Page->>Actions: Read protected_areas with no Site link (Proposed)
        activate Actions
        Actions->>Actions: requireApprovedAdmin()
        Actions->>DB: Read protected_areas rows (loaded by US 6.0.1)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Actions: Suggested boundaries
        deactivate DB
        Actions-->>Page: Suggestions
        deactivate Actions
        Page-->>Admin: Show suggestions on a map (Proposed)
        Admin->>Page: Select a boundary (Proposed, AT1)
    end

    Admin->>Page: Enter the Site name. Select a county or "No county"
    Page->>Actions: findSitesWithName(namesite), when the name field loses focus
    activate Actions
    Actions->>Actions: requireApprovedAdmin()
    Actions->>DB: Read sites_pa.namesite with ilike (case ignored, wildcards escaped),<br/>active and inactive
    activate DB
    DB-->>Actions: Matching rows
    deactivate DB
    Actions-->>Page: Matching names, case ignored
    deactivate Actions
    opt A Site with the same name exists (AT2)
        Page-->>Admin: Show a possible-duplicate warning (add-site-duplicate-warning).<br/>The Admin can still save
    end

    Admin->>Page: Select Save
    Page->>Page: Check the name. It is the only required field. The county is optional
    alt The name is empty (AT3)
        Page-->>Admin: Block creation. Red border on the name, aria-invalid,<br/>and "Site name is required."
    else The name is filled
        Page->>Actions: createSite(namesite, ab_county)
        activate Actions
        Actions->>Actions: requireApprovedAdmin() reads app_metadata.role<br/>and app_metadata.authenticated from auth.getUser()
        alt Caller is not an Admin, for example a Steward<br/>who sends the request directly (AT4)
            Actions-->>Page: requireApprovedAdmin() throws "Only admins can edit sites."<br/>No Site created
            Page-->>Admin: Show the error in an alert
        else Caller is an Admin
            Actions->>Actions: Trim the name. If empty, throw "Site name is required." (AT3)
            Actions->>DB: Insert sites_pa row (namesite, ab_county, is_active = true)
            activate DB
            alt Name already exists (23505)
                DB-->>Actions: Unique violation on namesite
                Actions-->>Page: Error "A site with this name already exists."
                Page-->>Admin: Show the error in an alert. The modal stays open
            else Other insert error
                DB-->>Actions: Error
                Actions-->>Page: Error (error.message or "Failed to create site")
                Page-->>Admin: Show the error in an alert. The modal stays open
            else Insert done
                DB-->>Actions: OK
                Actions-->>Page: OK
                Page->>Actions: getAllSites()
                Actions->>DB: Read sites_pa rows
                DB-->>Actions: Sites
                Actions-->>Page: Sites
                Page-->>Admin: Close the modal. Show the new Site in the list
            end
            deactivate DB
        end
        deactivate Actions
    end
    deactivate Page

    Note over Admin,DB: A new Site is active by default (US 2.0.3 AT5). getSitesOnline reads active Sites, so the new Site<br/>shows in Site search (AT5). The Admin can save after the duplicate warning. The database then refuses an exact duplicate,<br/>because namesite is UNIQUE. The ilike check ignores case, but the UNIQUE constraint does not.<br/>Open question: how a Site links to a boundary in protected_areas. protected_areas.site_id was dropped (20261006010000).
